    <name>
      <text>POPULATION PROJECTION_q1</text>
    </name>
    <questiontext format="moodle_auto_format">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>Given the following female population of Trinidad in \(1960\) and \(1975\), calculate the projection of the female population in \(1990\).</p>
<p>
<table border="solid">
  <tr>
    <th width="15%", style="text-align:center">Age</th>
    <th width="15%", style="text-align:center">\(1960\)</th>
    <th width="15%", style="text-align:center">\(1975\)</th>
  </tr>
  <tr>
  <td style="text-align:center">\(0-14\)</td>
    <td style="text-align:center">\({@ageset_1a@}\)</td>
    <td style="text-align:center">\({@ageset_1b@}\)</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td style="text-align:center">\(15-29\)</td>
    <td style="text-align:center">\({@ageset_2a@}\)</td>
    <td style="text-align:center">\({@ageset_2b@}\)</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td style="text-align:center">\(30-44\)</td>
    <td style="text-align:center">\({@ageset_3a@}\)</td>
    <td style="text-align:center">\({@ageset_3b@}\)</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td style="text-align:center">\(45-59\)</td>
    <td style="text-align:center">\({@ageset_4a@}\)</td>
    <td style="text-align:center">\({@ageset_4b@}\)</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td style="text-align:center">60+</td>
    <td style="text-align:center">\({@ageset_5a@}\)</td>
    <td style="text-align:center">\({@ageset_5b@}\)</td>
  </tr>
</table>
</p>
<p>During the period \(1960-1975\), the female live births were distributed as follows:</p>
<p>\(15-29……….{@births_1@}\)</p>
<p>\(30-44……….{@births_2@}\)</p>
<!--<p>You may assume that there is mortality and fertility are constant, there is no net migration, and ages are distributed uniformly within each age group.</p>-->
<hr>
<p>Note: Leave your answer correct to \(3\) dp</p>
<p>Calculate the survivorship ratios; you may assume that \(P_4=P_5\).</p>
<p>\(\text{P}_1=\) [[input:ans4]] [[validation:ans4]][[feedback:prt4]]</p>
<p>\(\text{P}_2=\) [[input:ans5]] [[validation:ans5]][[feedback:prt5]]</p>
<p>\(\text{P}_3=\) [[input:ans6]] [[validation:ans6]][[feedback:prt6]]</p>
<p>\(\text{P}_4=\) [[input:ans7]] [[validation:ans7]][[feedback:prt7]]</p>
<p>\(\text{P}_5=\) [[input:ans8]] [[validation:ans8]][[feedback:prt8]]</p>
<br>
<p>Find the Probability of a baby born surviving to time \(t+15\) which is denoted as \(P_{b} =\) [[input:ans3]] [[validation:ans3]][[feedback:prt3]]</p>
<p>Find the fertility rate \(f_j^*\) for ages \(15-29, 30-44\)</p>  
<p>\(f_2^*=\) [[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]][[feedback:prt1]]</p>
<p>\(f_3^*=\) [[input:ans2]] [[validation:ans2]][[feedback:prt2]]</p>
<p>Using the information above, project the population for \(1990\).</p>
<p>Note: Round your answer to the nearest integer</p>
<table border="solid">
  <tr>
    <th width="15%", style="text-align:center">Age</th>
    <th width="15%", style="text-align:center">\(1975\)</th>
<th width="15%", style="text-align:center">\(1990\)</th>
  </tr>
  <tr>
  <td style="text-align:center">\(0-14\)</td>
    <td style="text-align:center">\({@ageset_1b@}\)</td>
    <td style="text-align:center">[[input:ans9]] [[validation:ans9]][[feedback:prt9]]</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td style="text-align:center">\(15-29\)</td>
    <td style="text-align:center">\({@ageset_2b@}\)</td>
    <td style="text-align:center">[[input:ans10]] [[validation:ans10]][[feedback:prt10]]</td>
  </tr>
<tr>
    <td style="text-align:center">\(30-44\)</td>
    <td style="text-align:center">\({@ageset_3b@}\)</td>
    <td style="text-align:center">[[input:ans11]] [[validation:ans11]][[feedback:prt11]]</td>
  </tr>
<tr>
    <td style="text-align:center">\(44-59\)</td>
    <td style="text-align:center">\({@ageset_4b@}\)</td>
